{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new adventure set in the beloved Placid Plastic Duck universe!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Genre Mashup</strong><br>A surreal game featuring card battles and a sprinkle of deck-building mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of adventure-game and RPG-lite elements, with multiple-choice dialogue and beautiful, old-school top-down pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>A Story of Friendship</strong> <br>You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make things right with her best friend. To do that, you\u2019ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is\u2026 well, you\u2019re not very good at cards. Or rather, you\u2019re really bad. Actually, you don\u2019t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck Cards Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the card game. Challenge and defeat eccentric and evil characters, each with their own unique deck, to move forward in your quest  armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the world, search for additional cards, and expand your deck. The ducks hide in the most surprising places\u2026 but they love you. Your collection will follow you until the end, and maybe even beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big decisions await you along the way. Choose your answers. Stick to your values. Let the future unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join them.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hail the King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/cce62a51eaa70ee717d4a7d3490376cec2667144.jpg"},{"name":"Empty your pockets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/1c42ec60cc6ab95525006dbfb70c5e431e078b2f.jpg"},{"name":"Placid Plastic Deck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/7134048400cd42c584273c2aa78dab31a53e6b79.jpg"},{"name":"More ducks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/c6f100421b5f031589f34a8d2decaa0e61a0698b.jpg"},{"name":"Mod away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/42684a36b9449a6f40fbcd4f866419623dd549bd.jpg"},{"name":"Way to the shore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/9f0e2737c933dd568c18011c8e1cd249c98ae634.jpg"},{"name":"The dunes have eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/61985d1492ee02e4086d571afebdb00700c5a04d.jpg"},{"name":"Do the monkey!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/627cc52c4b69670611548dc55c58c76e6b352c8d.jpg"},{"name":"Mondobuzzo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/4ec999ec2732f54ec6aaa49dcfcbb220133af789.jpg"},{"name":"And the story ends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2510020/955ea09c6b122d79b6c4bdbf41333752019b6f0a.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510020?t=1771847612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2510020?t=1771847612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/daf69206b0f8c4285ff6d92b7b5bdc0c8c31623b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771847612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/daf69206b0f8c4285ff6d92b7b5bdc0c8c31623b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771847612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of hand-crafted 2D and 3D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed decks and boards, each with its own personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple-choice, branching dialogues leading to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable and peculiar characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt, story-rich adventure lasting approximately 5\u20137 hours</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new adventure set in the beloved Placid Plastic Duck universe!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Genre Mashup</strong><br>A surreal game featuring card battles and a sprinkle of deck-building mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of adventure-game and RPG-lite elements, with multiple-choice dialogue and beautiful, old-school top-down pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>A Story of Friendship</strong> <br>You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make things right with her best friend. To do that, you\u2019ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is\u2026 well, you\u2019re not very good at cards. Or rather, you\u2019re really bad. Actually, you don\u2019t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck Cards Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the card game. Challenge and defeat eccentric and evil characters, each with their own unique deck, to move forward in your quest  armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the world, search for additional cards, and expand your deck. The ducks hide in the most surprising places\u2026 but they love you. Your collection will follow you until the end, and maybe even beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.poster.avif?t=1771847612\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.webm?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.mp4?t=1771847612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big decisions await you along the way. Choose your answers. Stick to your values. Let the future unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join them.</p>","developers":["turbolento games","Fantastico Studio"],"dlc":[4361990],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/dccfe9468edba46a5335ebae5131c1e7087a4f9a/header.jpg?t=1771847612","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Placid Plastic Deck - A Quiet Quest \u00a92024. Published by turbolento games and Fantastico Studio. Developed by turbolento games and Fantastico Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple m2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple m2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760695396","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760695396","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760695396","id":257211444,"name":"Placid Plastic Deck - Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https:/